# Check out text files with LF on every OS: rt writes LF (RS ST-4), the expected files are byte contracts, and the
# Windows binary must bundle LF resources (rt init). Without this, Git on Windows converts them to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact test data: projects.pl.csv deliberately has CRLF line endings and a BOM (RS 3.4 example).
*.csv -text

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
